# CyberVets SSL Toolkit

- PowerShell script for attaching ACM certs to CloudFront or ALB with optional Route 53 updates
- Always use us-east-1 for CloudFront ACM; ALB cert must match ALB region
- Prefer exact domain match for certs; fallback to wildcard; pick newest by NotAfter
- CloudFront: SNI-only, TLSv1.2_2021, redirect-to-https on all behaviors
- Route 53: CloudFront hosted zone Z2FDTNDATAQYW2; ALB uses CanonicalHostedZoneId
- Supports -WhatIf, -CertificateArn, -DistributionId, -LoadBalancerArn, -ListenerArn
